#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezivamile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Igama Lokuhlola Isevisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Igama eliboniswayo lalokhu Kuhlolwa Kwesevisi, futhi elifakwe kunoma yiziphi izaziso Ze-Alamu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Imizamo emingaki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "I-Cacti izama ukwenza ukuhlolwa ngakunye izikhathi eziningi. Umzamo wokuqala ophumelelayo uqeda ukuhlolwa bese urekhoda impumelelo. Uma kungekho emizamweni ephumelelayo, ukuhlolwa kuyanqanyulwa bese kurekhodwa ukuhluleka. Inani eliphezulu lidala isikhathi eside sokuhlolwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Nika amandla ukuhlolwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Susa ukumaka leli bhokisi ukuze ukhubaze ukuhlolwa kwalokhu kuhlola."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Nika amandla ukusebenzisa iskripthi kulokhu kuhlolwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Uma umsebenzi womhlaba jikelele Wokusebenzisa Umyalo unikwe amandla, ungasetha lapha ukuthi isikripthi kufanele sisebenze kulokhu kuhlolwa noma cha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "I-Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "I-Poller okuzokwenziwa kuyo ukuhlolwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwesevisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Luhlobo luni lwesevisi?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Ikheli le-IP noma igama le-DNS leseva"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Ungacacisa elinye ichweba (example.com:5000) uma kungenjalo kuzosetshenziswa elizenzakalelayo. Kukheli lezinombolo le-IPv6 sebenzisa i-[ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Ku-DOH (DNS over HTTPS) sebenzisa lapha igama leseva (isibonelo 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Xazulula i-DNS ibe Ikheli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Faka Ikheli le-IP ukuze uphoqe igama le-DNS lixazululeke kulo. Ukushiya kungenalutho kuzosebenzisa Ukuxazululwa kwe-DNS esikhundleni salokho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo zesevisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Khetha isiqinisekiso esifanele"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "I-OID ye-SNMP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Faka i-SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Umyalo we-SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Faka umyalo we-SSH onendlela ephelele, umphumela womyalo uzobuyiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Izitifiketi zakho ze-CA neziphakathi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Ukusesha kwe-LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Isihlungi sokusesha se-LDAP, kungaba ngu-,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Igama le-DNS Lombuzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Igama le-DNS lokubuza. Nge-DOH (i-DNS nge-HTTPS) sebenzisa /resolve?name=example.com noma /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Ngombhalo osobala we-DNS amarekhodi e-A nawe-AAAA azobuyiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Ingxenye Yendlela Ye-URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Kusevisi yewebhu faka okungenani \"/\" noma okuthile okufana no-\"/any/path/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Kudinga Ukuqinisekiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi uma isayithi ngokuvamile libuyisa Iphutha le-401 njengoba lidinga igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Iseva ye-Proxy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Uma lo mbhalo wokuxhumana udinga i-proxy, yikhethe lapha. Ngaphandle kwalokho khetha 'Lutho'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Hlola Isitifiketi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa i-SSL, khetha leli bhokisi uma ufuna ukuqinisekisa isitifiketi. Kuvuliwe ngokuzenzakalelayo, kuvale uma isayithi lisebenzisa isitifiketi esizisayinelwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Hlola futhi wazise ngokuphelelwa yisikhathi kwesitifiketi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa i-SSL, khetha leli bhokisi uma ufuna ukuhlola ukuphela kwesitifiketi. Ungasetha ezilungiselelweni ukuthi izinsuku ezingaki ngaphambi kokuphela okufanele waziswe ngazo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Amapharamitha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Kufanele Kuhlolwe Kangaki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Hlola njalo ekusebenzeni kwe-Poller kwesi-x"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Isiqalisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Kufanele isevisi ibe PHANSI kangaki ngaphambi kokuba kuvuswe i-imeyili yesexwayiso."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Isaziso sesikhathi eside"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Uma isikhathi sokuhlola sikhulu kunaleli nani izikhathi eziningi zilandelana, thumela isaziso. Kuhlobene nokuguquguqukayo Kokubalwa kobude besikhathi. Ukuhlola kuthola isikhathi esiphezulu sokusebenza ezilungiselelweni. Uma kubekwe inani eliphakeme lapha, isikhathi esiphezulu sokusebenza siyileli nani + imizuzwana emi-2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Inani lokwephulwa kwesikhathi okulandelanayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Kufanele isibangeli sobude besikhathi seqiwe kangaki ngokulandelana ukuze kuthunyelwe isaziso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Imicu Yokuqinisekisa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Uchungechunge Lokusesha Impendulo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Lena intambo okufanele iseshwe empendulweni ukuze kutholakale isevisi esebenzayo futhi ephilayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
