#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Lena intambo okufanele iseshwe ekhasini Lokulungisa.  Ukuhlolwa Kwesevisi kuzohlola le ntambo uma intambo engenhla ingatholakali.  Uma itholakala, kusho ukuthi isevisi isalungiswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Uchungechunge Lokusesha Impendulo - Kwehlulekile"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Lena intambo okufanele iseshwe ukuze kutholakale ukwehluleka okwaziwayo empendulweni yesevisi.  Ukuhlolwa Kwesevisi kuzoveza i-alamu kuphela uma le ntambo itholakala, kuziba noma yiziphi izinkinga zokuphela kwesikhathi nezintambo zokusesha ezingenhla."

