#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Ingasetshenziselwa ukuhlolwa kwezinsizakalo eziningi:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - okuzikhethela, uma kusetiwe, zama ukuqinisekisa okuyisisekelo kwe-HTTP<br/><i>SMTP ku-port 587</i> - okuzikhethela. Ngaphandle kwegama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi, kuphela impendulo yeseva ehlolwayo. Ngegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi, ukungena nakho kuyenziwa<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - okuzikhethela. Ku-ftp engaziwa, sebenzisa igama lomsebenzisi elithi \"anonymous\" nekheli le-imeyili njengephasiwedi<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - kuyadingeka<br/><i>MQTT</i> - okuzikhethela<br/><i>Umyalo we-SCP, SSH</i> - ungasebenzisa le ndlela noma indlela yokhiye oyimfihlo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "I-Rest API - Ukuqinisekisa kwe-HTTP okuyisisekelo. Igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kuyadingeka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "I-Rest API - Ukuqinisekisa nge-API key<br/>Ukuqinisekisa kuthunyelwa ku-header ye-HTTP, ku-header yangokwezifiso noma ngendlela ye-POST. Imininingwane yokungena ku-URL ayisekelwa.<br/>Faka igama nevelu ye-API key. Womabili amanani ayadingeka. Ku-header ye-HTTP igama elithi <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> livame ukusetshenziswa (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Ku-header yangokwezifiso <i>X-API-Key</i> ivame ukusetshenziswa (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Ku-POST <i>api_key</i> ivame ukusetshenziswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "I-Rest API - Ukuqinisekisa ngethokheni ye-OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Ungaba nekhi/ithokheni evela kuseva bese uyifaka lapha noma usebenzise ukugeleza kokuqinisekisa ngemininingwane yokungena. Igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kuthunyelwa kubhalwe ngendlela ye-Json."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "I-Rest API - Ukuqinisekisa okusekelwe ku-Cookie - womabili amanani ayadingeka. Ngemva kokungena ngemvume, kubuyiswa i-cookie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "I-SNMP v1 noma v2 - iyadingeka, faka igama lomphakathi lapha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "I-SNMP v3 - Izinga lokuphepha linquma ukuthi yimiphi imingcele edingekayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Ukhiye oyimfihlo we-SSH - Ungasetshenziselwa ukuhlolwa kwe-SCP noma komyalo we-SSH. Lokhu kuhlolwa kungasebenzisa negama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi futhi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Ihlola kuphela ukuthi iseva yewebhu iyaphendula yini. Uma kusetshenziswa imininingwane yegama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi, izozama ukuqinisekisa kwe-Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Kufana ne-HTTP plaintext kodwa kwengeza ikhono lokuhlola izitifiketi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Ihlola kuphela ukuthi iseva ye-SMTP iyaphendula yini. Akukho ukuqinisekiswa kobunikazi. Uzobona ibhana yokungena yeseva kanye nempendulo ye-ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Okungabethelwe + STARTTLS. Kungenzeka futhi ukuhlola ukuba semthethweni kwesitifiketi. Ngaphandle kwegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi, uzobona ibhena yokungena yeseva nempendulo ye-ehlo. Ngezifakazelo, ukungena kuzokwenziwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Uxhumano olubethelwe embobeni ezenzakalelayo 465. Kungenzeka futhi ukuhlola ukusebenza kwesitifiketi. Ngegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi i-AUTH LOGIN izohlolwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Uxhumano lwe-IMAP olungabethelwe. Ngaphandle kwezifakazelo, kuzohlolwa uxhumano kuphela. Uzobona ibhena yokungena kuphela. Ngezifakazelo, ukungena kuzohlolwa futhi kuzanywe ukufunda uhlu lwemilayezo. Ungasebenzisa indlela ye-AUTHENTICATE PLAIN noma ye-AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Kufana ne-IMAP engabethelwe kodwa ngemva kokungena ngemvume kusetshenziswa i-STARTTLS. Kuyenzeka futhi ukuhlola ukusebenza kwesitifiketi ngemva kwe-STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "I-IMAP ebethelwe, ungazama ukungena futhi uhlole isitifiketi nokungena komsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Uxhumano lwe-POP3 olungabethelwe. Ngaphandle kwezifakazelo, kuzohlolwa uxhumano kuphela. Uzobona ibhena yokungena kuphela. Ngezifakazelo, ukungena kuzohlolwa futhi kuzanywe ukufunda uhlu lwemilayezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Kufana ne-POP3 engabethelwe kodwa ngemva kokungena ngemvume kusetshenziswa i-STARTTLS. Kuyenzeka futhi ukuhlola ukusebenza kwesitifiketi ngemva kwe-STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "I-POP3 ebethelwe, ungazama ukungena futhi uhlole isitifiketi nokungena komsebenzisi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Zama ukuxazulula irekhodi le-DNS kuseva ye-DNS ecacisiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Zama i-DNS nge-HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Wonke amapharamitha ayadingeka. Yenza ukungena kwe-LDAP okungabethelwe nokusesha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Wonke amapharamitha ayadingeka. Yenza ukungena kwe-LDAP okubethelwe nokusesha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Uxhumano lwe-FTP olungabethelwe, ngena futhi uzame ukulanda ifayela elishiwo endleleni (/path/to/file.txt). Kuxhumano olungaziwa sebenzisa igama lokungena *anonymous* nekheli le-imeyili njengephasiwedi. Okuqukethwe kwefayela kuyabuyiselwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Zama ukulanda ifayela elicaciswe endleleni (/path/to/file.txt) kusuka kuseva ye-TFTP. Okuqukethwe kwefayela kuyabuyiswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Uxhumano lwe-SCP olubethelwe, ngena futhi uzame ukulanda ifayela elishiwo endleleni (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Zama umgomo we-SMB, igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kuyadingeka. Zama ukungena bese ulanda ifayela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Xhuma kuseva ye-MQTT bese ulalela noma yimuphi umlayezo. Ungacacisa isihloko kuMzila (bedroom/temp), ushiye kungenalutho nganoma yisiphi isihloko. Kuleli hlolo kunconywa ukukhulisa \"Isexwayiso sesikhathi eside\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa kwe-REST API ngokuqinisekisa okuyisisekelo kwe-HTTP. Lungiselela izifakazo zokungena kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa kwe-REST API ngokuqinisekisa kwesikhiye se-API. Lungiselela izifakazo zokungena kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa kwe-REST API nge-Oauth2. Lungiselela izifakazo zokungena kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa kwe-REST API ngokuqinisekisa kwekhukhi. Lungiselela izifakazo zokungena kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Zama indlela ye-SNMP get. Okuphumayo kwe-OID ecacisiwe kuyabuyiswa. Imininingwane yokungena iyadingeka, kufanele ulungiselele imininingwane ye-SNMP v.1,2 noma v3 kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Zama indlela ye-SNMP walk. Okuphumayo kwe-OID ecacisiwe kuyabuyiswa. Imininingwane yokungena iyadingeka, kufanele ulungiselele imininingwane ye-SNMP v.1,2 noma v3 kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-ssh futhi uxhume kumsingathi okude. Ngemva kokungena ngemvume sebenzisa umyalo oshiwo bese ubuyisela umphumela. Igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi noma ukhiye oyimfihlo kungenzeka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Iphrothokholi ye-SFTP embobeni 22, igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi nendlela kuyadingeka. Zama ukwenza uhlu lwamafolda lwendlela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Konke kuhamba kahle. Qhubeka njengokujwayelekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "I-URL oyidlulisele ku-libcurl isebenzise iphrothokholi le libcurl engayisekeli. Ukusekelwa kungaba inketho yesikhathi sokuhlanganisa ongayisebenzisanga, kungaba uchungechunge lwephrothokholi olubhalwe ngokungalungile noma iphrothokholi i-libcurl engenalo ikhodi layo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Ikhodi yokuqalisa kusenesikhathi yehlulekile. Lokhu kungenzeka kube yiphutha noma inkinga yangaphakathi, noma inkinga yezinsiza lapho okuthile okuyisisekelo kwehluleka ukwenziwa ngesikhathi sokuqalisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "I-URL ayihlelwanga ngendlela efanele."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Isici esiceliwe, iphrothokholi noma inketho ayitholakalanga yakhelwe ngaphakathi kule libcurl ngenxa yesinqumo sangesikhathi sokwakha. Lokhu kusho ukuthi isici noma inketho ayinikwanga amandla noma yakhutshazwa ngokuqondile ngenkathi kwakhiwa i-libcurl futhi ukuze isebenze kufanele uthole i-libcurl eyakhiwe kabusha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukuxazulula i-proxy. Umsingathi we-proxy onikeziwe awukwazanga ukuxazululwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukuxazulula umsingathi. Umsingathi okude onikeziwe awuzange uxazululwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukwenza i-connect() kumsingathi noma ku-proxy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Iseva ithumele idatha i-libcurl engakwazanga ukuyihlaziya. Le khodi yephutha yayaziwa nge-CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY ngaphambi kwe-7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Sinqatshelwe ukufinyelela kusisetshenziswa esinikezwe ku-URL. Ku-FTP, lokhu kwenzeka ngenkathi kuzanywa ukushintshela kuhla lwemibhalo olukude."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Ngenkathi kulindwe iseva ukuthi ixhume emuva lapho kusetshenziswa iseshini ye-FTP esebenzayo, kuthunyelwe ikhodi yephutha ngoxhumo lokulawula noma okufanayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Ngemva kokuthumela iphasiwedi ye-FTP kuseva, i-libcurl ilindele impendulo efanele. Le khodi yephutha ibonisa ukuthi kubuyiswe ikhodi ebingalindelekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Ngesikhathi seseshini ye-FTP esebenzayo ngenkathi kulindwe iseva ukuthi ixhume, isikhathi sokulinda se-CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (noma esizenzakalelayo sangaphakathi) siphelelwe yisikhathi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "I-Libcurl ihlulekile ukuthola umphumela ozwakalayo kuseva njengempendulo yomyalo we-PASV noma we-EPSV. Iseva inephutha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Amaseva e-FTP abuyisa umugqa we-227 njengempendulo kumyalo we-PASV. Uma i-libcurl ihluleka ukuhlaziya lowo mugqa, le khodi yokubuya ibuyiselwa emuva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Ukwehluleka kwangaphakathi ukubheka umsingathi osetshenziswa ekuxhumekeni okusha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Kutholakale inkinga kungqimba lokuhlela amafreyimu lwe-HTTP2. Lokhu kuvamile futhi kungaba yinkinga eyodwa kweziningana, bheka ibhafa yamaphutha ukuze uthole imininingwane."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Kutholwe iphutha ngenkathi kuzanywa ukusetha indlela yokudlulisa ibe ngu-binary noma i-ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Ukudluliswa kwefayela bekukufushane noma kukhulu kunalokho obekulindelwe. Lokhu kwenzeka uma iseva iqala ngokubika usayizi wokudlulisa olindelwe, bese iletha idatha engahambisani nosayizi obunikezwe ngaphambilini."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Lokhu bekuyimpendulo engajwayelekile kumyalo we-'RETR' noma ukuqedwa kokudluliswa kwamabhayithi ayiziro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Iphutha elingasasebenzi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Akusetshenziswa ezinguqulweni zesimanje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Uma kuthunyelwa imiyalo yangokwezifiso ethi \\\"QUOTE\\\" kuseva ekude, omunye wemiyalo ubuyise ikhodi yephutha engu-400 noma ngaphezulu (ye-FTP) noma ngandlela thize wakhombisa ukuqedwa okungaphumelelanga komyalo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Lokhu kuyabuyiswa uma i-CURLOPT_FAILONERROR isethelwe ku-true futhi iseva ye-HTTP ibuyisa ikhodi yephutha engu->= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Kuvele iphutha ngenkathi kubhalwa idatha etholiwe efayeleni lendawo, noma kwabuyiselwa iphutha ku-libcurl kusuka ku-callback yokubhala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukuqala ukulayisha. Ku-FTP, iseva ngokuvamile inqabile umyalo we-STOR. Ibhafa yephutha ngokuvamile iqukethe incazelo yeseva ngalokhu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Kube nenkinga yokufunda ifayela lasendaweni noma iphutha elibuyiswe i-callback yokufunda."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Isicelo sokwabiwa kwenkumbulo sihlulekile. Lokhu kuyinkinga enkulu futhi izinto zokonakala kakhulu uma lokhu kuze kwenzeke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Isikhathi somsebenzi siphelile. Isikhathi sokuphela esicacisiwe sifinyelelwe ngokuya ngemibandela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Umyalo we-FTP PORT ubuyisele iphutha. Lokhu kwenzeka kakhulu uma ungacacisanga ikheli elanele ukuze i-libcurl ilisebenzise. Bheka i-CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Umyalo we-FTP REST ubuyisele iphutha. Lokhu akufanele kwenzeke uma iseva isebenza kahle."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Iseva ayisekeli noma ayikwamukeli ukucelwa kwezinga (range requests)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Leli yiphutha elingajwayelekile elivame ukwenzeka ngenxa yokudideka kwangaphakathi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Kwenzeke inkinga ndawana thize ekuxhumaneni kwe-SSL/TLS. Udinga ngempela ibhafa yamaphutha ufunde umlayezo lapho njengoba ukhomba inkinga ngokunembe kakhudlwana. Kungaba izitifiketi (amafomethi amafayela, izindlela, izimvume), amaphasiwedi, nokunye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Ukulanda akukwazanga ukuqhutshwa ngoba i-offset eshiwo ibingaphandle komngcele wefayela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Ifayela elinikezwe nge-FILE:// alikwazanga ukuvulwa. Kungenzeka kakhulu ngoba indlela yefayela ayikhombi ifayela elikhona. Uhlolile izimvume zefayela?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "I-LDAP ayikwazi ukuxhuma (bind). Umsebenzi we-LDAP bind uhlulekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Ukusesha kwe-LDAP kuhlulekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Umsebenzi awutholakalanga. Umsebenzi odingekayo we-zlib awutholakalanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Kunqanyulwe yi-callback. I-callback ibuyisele u-\"abort\" ku-libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Umsebenzi ubizwe ngepharamitha engalungile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Iphutha lesixhumi esibonakalayo. Isixhumi esibonakalayo esiphumayo esishiwo asikwazanga ukusetshenziswa. Setha ukuthi yisiphi isixhumi esibonakalayo okufanele sisetshenziselwe ikheli le-IP lomthombo woxhumo oluphumayo nge-URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Ukuphambukisa okuningi kakhulu. Ngenkathi ilandela ukuphambukisa, i-libcurl ifinyelele esibalweni esiphezulu. Setha umkhawulo wakho nge-CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Inketho edluliselwe ku-libcurl ayaziwa/ayiqashelwa. Bheka imibhalo efanele. Lokhu cishe kuyinkinga kuhlelo olusebenzisa i-libcurl. Isilondolozi sephutha singase sibe nolwazi oluqondile mayelana nokuthi iyiphi inketho ethintekayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Inketho edluliselwe ku-setopt yayifomethwe ngokungalungile. Bheka umlayezo wephutha ukuze uthole imininingwane ngokuthi iyiphi inketho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Akukho lutho olubuyisiwe kusuka kuseva, futhi ngaphansi kwalezi zimo, ukungatholi lutho kuthathwa njengephutha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Injini ye-crypto eshiwo ayitholakalanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukusetha injini yokubhala ngemfihlo ye-SSL ekhethiwe njengezenzakalelayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukuthumela idatha yenethiwekhi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Ukuhluleka ekutholeni idatha yenethiwekhi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "kunenkinga ngesitifiketi seklayenti sasendaweni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukusebenzisa i-cipher ecacisiwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Isitifiketi se-SSL noma izigxivizo zomunwe ze-SSH zeseva ekude zithathwe njengezingalungile. Le khodi yephutha ihlanganiswe ne-CURLE_SSL_CACERT kusukela ku-7.62.0. Inani layo langaphambilini kwakungu-51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Ukubhala ngamakhodi kokudlulisa okungaqashelwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Usayizi omkhulu wefayela udluliwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Izinga le-FTP SSL eliceliwe lihlulekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Ngenkathi kwenzeka ukuthumela, i-curl bekufanele ihlehlise idatha ukuze iphinde iyithumele, kodwa ukuhlehlisa kuhlulekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Ukuqaliswa kwenjini ye-SSL kwehlulekile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Iseva ekude yenqabele i-curl ukuthi ingene ngemvume (Kwengezwe ku-7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ifayela alitholakalanga kuseva ye-TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Inkinga yemvume kuseva ye-TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Isikhala sediski siphelile kuseva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Ukusebenza kwe-TFTP okungekho emthethweni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "I-ID yokudlulisa ye-TFTP engaziwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Ifayela selivele likhona futhi alibhalwa ngaphezulu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Leli phutha akufanele libuyiswe yiseva ye-TFTP esebenza kahle."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Inkinga ekufundeni isitifiketi se-SSL CA (indlela? amalungelo okufinyelela?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Insiza okukhulunywe ngayo ku-URL ayikho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Kuvele iphutha elingachaziwe ngesikhathi seseshini ye-SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukuvala uxhumano lwe-SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Isokhethi ayikakulungeli ukuthumela/ukwamukela, linda ize ilunge bese uzama futhi. Le khodi yokubuya ibuyiswa kuphela ku-curl_easy_recv naku-curl_easy_send (Kungezwe ku-7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukulayisha ifayela le-CRL (Kwengezwe ku-7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa komkhiphi kuhlulekile (Kwengezwe ku-7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Iseva ye-FTP ayiwuqondi nhlobo umyalo we-PRET noma ayisekeli i-argument enikeziwe. Qaphela lapho usebenzisa i-CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, umyalo we-LIST wangokwezifiso uthunyelwa nomyalo we-PRET ngaphambi kwe-PASV futhi. (Kungezwe ku-7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Ukungafani kwezinombolo ze-RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Ukungafani Kwezihlonzi Zeseshini ye-RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Ayikwazi ukuhlaziya uhlu lwamafayela e-FTP (ngesikhathi sokulanda nge-wildcard ye-FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Ukubuyiselwa kwesigaba kubike iphutha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Kokusetshenziswa ngaphakathi kuphela, akukaze kubuyiswe yi-libcurl) Akukho ukuxhumana okutholakalayo, iseshini isemgqeni wokulinda. (kungezwe ku-7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Ihlulekile ukufanisa ukhiye ophiniwe ocaciswe nge-CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Isimo sibuyise ukwehluleka lapho sibuzwa nge-CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Iphutha lokusakaza kusendlalelo sokufreyima se-HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-API ubizwe usuka ngaphakathi kwe-callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuqinisekisa ubuyise iphutha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Kutholakale inkinga kungqimba lwe-HTTP/3. Lokhu kuvamile futhi kungaba yinkinga eyodwa kweziningana, bheka ibhafa yamaphutha ukuze uthole imininingwane."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Iphutha lokuxhumana kwe-QUIC. Leli phutha lingadalwa yiphutha lelabhulali ye-SSL. I-QUIC iyiphrothokholi esetshenziselwa ukudluliswa kwe-HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Iphutha lokubambisana kwe-Proxy. I-CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR inikeza imininingwane eyengeziwe ngenkinga ethile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Isitifiketi Seklayenti se-SSL siyadingeka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Ukushaya kwangaphakathi ku-poll() noma ku-select() kubuyise iphutha elingalungiseki."

