#: setup.php
msgid "User Agent"
msgstr "I-User Agent"

#: setup.php
msgid "The User-Agent string sent with HTTP/HTTPS and other cURL based service checks. Some sites block old or uncommon browsers, so you can set a current User-Agent here. Leave blank to use the built-in default."
msgstr "Uchungechunge lwe-User-Agent oluthunyelwa nge-HTTP/HTTPS kanye nokunye ukuhlola kwesevisi okusekelwe ku-cURL. Amanye amasayithi avimba iziphequluli ezindala noma ezingajwayelekile, ngakho ungasetha i-User-Agent yamanje lapha. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise okuzenzakalelayo okwakhelwe ngaphakathi."

